# Copy

Full examples: `docs/COPY.md`.

- 4–5 words per line. Break the line; do not write a sentence.
- Shortest wording wins.
- Words a child can read.
- Buttons: Continue, Start, Hire, Plan myself.
- No jargon on screen (no dashboard, ecosystem, execute, submit).
- Helper text under a question is also 4–5 words.
